	(text "System-5 IO card Rev A (1861 video + PS/2 keyboard), one sheet per functional block:\n  sheet 2  Decode         BUS, I/O DECODE AND THE STROBE WINDOW\n  sheet 3  Keyboard       PS/2 KEYBOARD: PAK-VI DECODER, PIC16F84 SERIAL TO PARALLEL, CDP1852 INPUT PORT\n  sheet 4  1861           CDP1861 GRAPHICS: DISPLAY ON/OFF, DMA, COMPOSITE VIDEO, RIBBON TO THE CPU CARD\n  sheet 5  Power          POWER, DECOUPLING, LED\n\nRedrawn 2026-10-26 from the board netlist; proven pin for pin against it (gen_schematic.py).\n\nEvery net of a sheet is a pin of its sheet symbol here, labelled with the net's name. Above a dashed line:\nthe nets the sheet shares with other sheets (left: it reads them, right: it drives them). Below it: nets\ndrawn on that sheet only. VCC and GND are power symbols on the sheets." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "229cdb64-b1af-540f-a251-9cf028e4dd28"))
	(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
